   |
10 |   count = 3
   |   ----- `count` is declared here
...
17 |   puts size_of(count)
   |                ^^^^^ `size_of` takes a type
help: to use the type of `count`, write it
   |   puts size_of(Int)
   = see `wid explain E0322`

error[E0322]: expected a type
  --> tests/ui/type_args.wid:18:17
   |
18 |   puts align_of(count + 1)
   |                 ^^^^^^^^^ this is a value
help: types are written like `Vec2`, `[]Int`, `Int?`, `^Node` or `proc(Int) -> Int`
   = see `wid explain E0322`

