error[E0323]: `Int?` is a type, not a value
  --> tests/ui/type_args.wid:20:15
   |
20 |   puts double(Int?)
   |               ^^^^ a type cannot be used as a value here
help: for an empty `Int?`, write `nil` where `Int?` is expected
