error[E0323]: `proc(Int) -> Int` is a type, not a value
  --> tests/ui/type_args.wid:21:15
   |
21 |   puts double(proc(Int) -> Int)
   |               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ a type cannot be used as a value here
help: a `proc(Int) -> Int` value is a proc literal, like `->(a: Int) -> Int { … }`, or a method, `method(:name)`
